+// String x string equality core: s1 = propBVKeyLocal, s2 = propTaggedLocal
+// (i32 string ptrs, pre-set). Emits ptr-eq -> 1; both linear+latin1 -> len
+// guard + byte-scan loop; else miss() which must produce i32 (helper arm --
+// ropes/two-byte). Result: i32 on stack.
